  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma double cab Crew Cab with 4 full-size door\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Designed specifically for the 2024–2026 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab models with four full-size doors. Please verify the cab style matches the reference image before placing your order.\nTwo-Stage Angular Step Design: Features a 3.5-inch drop step that offers easier access in and out of the vehicle while maintaining solid ground clearance for off-road and daily driving. The step surfaces include textured anti-slip pads for added safety and grip.\nHeavy-Duty Construction: Built with robust carbon steel and shaped into a strong triangular tube, these side steps offer exceptional durability and can support up to 400 pounds of weight.\nDurable Protective Coating: Coated in a triple-layer matte black finish for superior resistance to rust, wear, UV damage, and slipping. The aerodynamic panel layout also contributes to improved fuel efficiency.\nHassle-Free Installation: Comes complete with six mounting brackets, hardware, and clear installation instructions. No drilling is required—installation can be completed in about 20 minutes with basic tools.\nProfessional installation recommended",
